  "releaseNotes": "This version based on commit https://github.com/AvaloniaCommunity/Material.Avalonia/commit/d2e1611dd88b4a28715b537196ad43cd44184fcf\n\nImplement badge component (#463)\n\n* define MaterialValidationErrorForegroundBrush brush\n\nUsed for badge control. ITheme.ValidationError prop is now ColorPair.\n\n* implement badge control\n\nCreate badge and badged controls. Badge is a simple badge. Badged makes it easy to attach a badge to button, icon, or other controls.\n\n* add demo for Badge and Badged\n\n* Add badge increment sample in demo\n\n* Set BadgeWidth and BadgeHeight default to NaN\n\n* Fix ValidationError assignment in ReadOnlyTheme.cs\n\n* Rollback ValidationError to Color, setup MaterialValidationErrorForegroundBrush as black\n\n* Move BadgePlacement to proper namespace\n\n* Fix MaterialValidationErrorForegroundBrush\n\n* Fix demo\n\n* Remove unnecessary Panel from Badge template\n\n* Make FontSize inherited by default, some padding coerce\n\n* Rename HasContent to DisplayContent, make it bool?, make content driven by default, enrich demo\n\n* Add Error mode to ColorZoneMode\n\n* Add ColorMode property to Badge and Badged\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: SKProCH <skproch@yandex.ru>",
